<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-BAD NEWS FOR AUSTRALIAN REFEREE.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-BAD NEWS FOR AUSTRALIAN REFEREE.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian referee Scott Young, set to take charge of the Wales-Ireland Five Nations match this weekend, will not be on duty at Cardiff Arms Park after suffering a serious knee injury.</p>
<p>Young was hurt during a Welsh club game on Saturday and will require surgery on his right knee. His replacement has yet to be announced.</p>
</text>
